        <mxCell id="dn" value='blocked → approve only with &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;--because&lt;/font&gt; · a proposed draft cannot be recorded as sent · text the user sent by hand: &lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;sent --text-file&lt;/font&gt;' style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="615" width="850" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
